---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "GoOrganicAfrica — Free Farm Profit Calculator & Organic Farming Guides for Africa"
description: "Free farm profit calculator for Nigerian and African farmers. Calculate farming costs, revenue, profit and ROI across {{ site.calculator.enterpriseCount }} farming enterprises in {{ site.calculator.countryCount }} African countries. Expert organic farming guides on hydroponic fodder, mushroom farming, black soldier fly farming and cassava production."
permalink: "/"
---

<section class="hero" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green-deep) 0%, var(--green-mid) 100%); color: var(--white); padding: 64px 0 80px;">
<div class="container hero-grid">

<div class="hero-copy">
<span class="eyebrow" style="color: var(--gold);" data-i18n="free_tool">Free Farming Tool</span>

<h1 style="color: var(--white);" data-i18n="hero_title">Know Your Farm Profit Before You Plant</h1>

<p class="lede" style="color: var(--white); max-width: 52ch;" data-i18n="hero_description">
Calculate your cost of production, expected revenue, profit, ROI and break-even point — free, across Nigeria and Africa, in your own currency.
</p>

<ul class="hero-bullets" style="color: var(--white);">
<li id="hp-country-line">{{ site.calculator.countryCount }} African countries{% if site.data.featuredCountryNames | length %} — including {{ site.data.featuredCountryNames | join(", ") }}{% if site.calculator.countryCount > 3 %} &amp; more{% endif %}{% endif %}</li>
<li data-i18n="crops_livestock">Crops, livestock &amp; more — continuously expanding</li>
<li data-i18n="farm_size">Enter farm size in acres, plots or hectares</li>
<li data-i18n="local_numbers">Override any figure with your own local numbers</li>
<li data-i18n="profit_scenarios">Conservative, Expected &amp; Optimistic profit scenarios</li>
</ul>

<div class="hero-actions">
<a class="btn btn-primary" href="/farm-profit-calculator/" style="background:var(--gold);color:var(--green-deep);box-shadow:3px 3px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.3);" data-i18n="calculate_profit">
▶ Calculate My Farm Profit
</a>

<a class="btn btn-outline" href="/ebooks/" style="border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);color:var(--white);" data-i18n="browse_guides">
Browse Farming Guides
</a>
</div>
</div>

<a href="/farm-profit-calculator/" style="text-decoration:none;">
<div class="packet" style="background:var(--white); box-shadow:8px 8px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.25);">

<div class="packet-header">
<span class="packet-batch" style="color:var(--soil);" data-i18n="free_tool_upper">FREE TOOL</span>
<span style="font-size:2.2rem;">🌿</span>
</div>

<h2 class="packet-title" data-i18n="calculator_title">Farm Profit Calculator Africa</h2>
<p class="packet-tagline" data-i18n="calculator_tagline">Plan Your Farm. Calculate Your Profit.</p>

<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin:16px 0;">

<div style="background:var(--sage-light);border-radius:8px;padding:10px;text-align:center;">
<div style="font-family:var(--font-label);font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--green-deep);">{{ site.calculator.cropCount }}</div>
<div style="font-size:0.72rem;color:var(--ink-soft);" data-i18n="crops_growing">Crops &amp; growing</div>
</div>

<div style="background:var(--sage-light);border-radius:8px;padding:10px;text-align:center;">
<div style="font-family:var(--font-label);font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--green-deep);">{{ site.calculator.livestockCount }}</div>
<div style="font-size:0.72rem;color:var(--ink-soft);" data-i18n="livestock_growing">Livestock &amp; growing</div>
</div>

</div>

<div class="packet-footer">
<span class="packet-price" style="color:var(--green-mid);" data-i18n="free_100">100% Free</span>
<span class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" data-i18n="open_calculator">Open Calculator</span>
</div>

</div>
</a>

</div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt" style="padding:32px 0;">
<div class="container">
<div class="trust-strip">

<div class="trust-item">
<span class="num">{{ site.calculator.enterpriseCount }}</span>
<span class="label" data-i18n="farming_enterprises">Farming enterprises</span>
</div>

<div class="trust-item">
<span class="num">{{ site.calculator.countryCount }}</span>
<span class="label" data-i18n="african_countries">African countries</span>
</div>

<div class="trust-item">
<span class="num">{{ site.calculator.regionCount }}</span>
<span class="label" data-i18n="regions">States / regions / provinces</span>
</div>

<div class="trust-item">
<span class="num">100%</span>
<span class="label" data-i18n="free_to_use">Free to use</span>
</div>

</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section">
<div class="container">

<div class="section-head">
<span class="eyebrow" data-i18n="how_it_works">How it works</span>
<h2 data-i18n="three_steps">Three Steps to Your Farm Profit Report</h2>
<p class="lede" data-i18n="no_signup">No sign-up. No payment. Just your numbers.</p>
</div>

<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;">

<div style="text-align:center;padding:24px 16px;">
<div style="font-size:2.4rem;margin-bottom:12px;">🌍</div>
<h3 style="font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:8px;" data-i18n="step1_title">1. Pick Your Country &amp; Crop</h3>
<p style="font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:0;" data-i18n="step1_text">Select your African country, your region, and the crop or livestock you plan to farm. Currency and data adjust automatically.</p>
</div>

<div style="text-align:center;padding:24px 16px;border-left:1px solid var(--line);border-right:1px solid var(--line);">
<div style="font-size:2.4rem;margin-bottom:12px;">✍️</div>
<h3 style="font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:8px;" data-i18n="step2_title">2. Enter Your Farm Details</h3>
<p style="font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:0;" data-i18n="step2_text">Choose farm size in acres, plots or hectares. Use our researched cost and price estimates, or enter your own local figures.</p>
</div>

<div style="text-align:center;padding:24px 16px;">
<div style="font-size:2.4rem;margin-bottom:12px;">📈</div>
<h3 style="font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:8px;" data-i18n="step3_title">3. Get Your Profit Report</h3>
<p style="font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:0;" data-i18n="step3_text">See your total investment, expected revenue, estimated profit, ROI, and break-even price — plus 3 scenarios and personalised advice.</p>
</div>

</div>

<div style="text-align:center;margin-top:32px;">
<a class="btn btn-primary" href="/farm-profit-calculator/" data-i18n="try_calculator">Try the Calculator — It's Free</a>
</div>

</div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
<div class="container">

<div class="section-head">
<span class="eyebrow" data-i18n="farming_guides">Farming Guides</span>
<h2 data-i18n="expert_guides">Go Deeper With Expert Guides</h2>
<p class="lede" data-i18n="guides_description">Step-by-step organic farming guides — written from real research and farm experience, not theory.</p>
</div>

<div class="ebook-grid">
{% for ebook in collections.ebooks %}
<a class="ebook-card" href="{{ ebook.url }}">
<img class="ebook-card-icon" src="{{ ebook.data.icon }}" alt="{{ ebook.data.title }} guide cover">
<h3>{{ ebook.data.title }}</h3>
<p class="tagline">{{ ebook.data.tagline }}</p>
<div class="card-footer">
<span class="price">{{ ebook.data.price | currency }}</span>
<span class="cta" data-i18n="view_guide">View Guide →</span>
</div>
</a>
{% endfor %}
</div>

<div style="text-align:center;margin-top:28px;">
<a class="btn btn-outline" href="/ebooks/" data-i18n="see_all_guides">See All Guides</a>
</div>

</div>
</section>

<section class="section">
<div class="container" style="display:flex;gap:48px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;">

<div style="flex:1;min-width:260px;">
<span class="eyebrow" data-i18n="about_goa">About GoOrganicAfrica</span>
<h2 data-i18n="about_title">Built from the Farm, Not the Classroom</h2>

<p style="color:var(--ink-soft);" data-i18n="about_text">
GoOrganicAfrica is built by Amoo Oluwatoyin Owolabi — farmer, agricultural researcher, and organic bio-fertilizer producer with a certificate in Agriculture since 2001. Every tool and guide here comes from real production experience across Nigeria, Cameroon and beyond.
</p>

<a class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" href="/about/" data-i18n="read_more">Read More</a>
</div>

<div style="flex:1;min-width:220px;">
<div class="trust-strip" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);">

<div class="trust-item">
<span class="num">{{ collections.ebooks.length }}</span>
<span class="label" data-i18n="practical_guides">Practical guides</span>
</div>

<div class="trust-item">
<span class="num">{{ site.calculator.countryCount }}</span>
<span class="label" data-i18n="calculator_countries">Calculator countries</span>
</div>

<div class="trust-item">
<span class="num">100%</span>
<span class="label" data-i18n="farm_tested">Farm-tested</span>
</div>

<div class="trust-item">
<span class="num">Free</span>
<span class="label" data-i18n="calculator_tool">Calculator tool</span>
</div>

</div>
</div>

</div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
<div class="container">

<div class="section-head">
<span class="eyebrow" data-i18n="from_blog">From the Blog</span>
<h2 data-i18n="blog_title">Farming Insights &amp; Market Analysis</h2>
<p class="lede">
<span data-i18n="blog_description">Practical articles across</span>
{{ collections.blogCategories | length }}
<span data-i18n="blog_categories">categories — written to help African farmers make better decisions.</span>
</p>
</div>

{% if collections.posts.length > 0 %}

<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:24px;">

{% for post in collections.posts | slice(0, 4) %}
<a href="{{ post.url }}" style="text-decoration:none;">

<div class="ebook-card" style="height:100%;">

{% if post.data.featured_image %}
<img src="{{ post.data.featured_image }}" alt="{{ post.data.title }}" style="width:100%;height:180px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:4px;">
{% endif %}

<span class="eyebrow" style="font-size:0.68rem;">{{ post.data.category }}</span>

<h3 style="font-size:1.05rem;">{{ post.data.title }}</h3>

<p class="tagline" style="font-size:0.88rem;">{{ post.data.description }}</p>

<div class="card-footer">
<span style="font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--ink-soft);" data-i18n="read_article">Read article</span>
<span class="cta">→</span>
</div>

</div>
</a>
{% endfor %}

</div>

<div style="text-align:center;margin-top:28px;">
<a class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" href="/blog/" data-i18n="explore_articles">Explore All Articles</a>
</div>

{% else %}

<div class="empty-state">
<p data-i18n="articles_future">Articles will appear here automatically when published from the admin panel.</p>
<a class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" href="/blog/" data-i18n="explore_blog">Explore Blog</a>
</div>

{% endif %}

</div>
</section>
